["<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">弁</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>辨别；花瓣；阀；方言；辩论</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ベン・ヘン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">かんむり・わきま.える・わ.ける・はなびら・あらそ.う</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">お弁当</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おべんとう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">便当；日式盒装午餐</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">弁当</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">べんとう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">便当；盒饭</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">勘弁</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かんべん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">原谅；宽恕；容忍</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">就</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>就任；从事；就（表示动作对象或依据）；完成；前往</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シュウ・ジュ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">つ.く・つ.ける</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">就職</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しゅうしょく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">就业；就职；找到工作</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">就く</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">つく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">就座；就任；担任（职务）；走上（路线等）；就职；受雇；登基；即位；踏上（旅途）；启程；出发；师从；拜师学艺；当学徒</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">就任</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しゅうにん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">就任；上任；就职；赴任</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">異</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>不同；异常；奇怪；奇特；罕见</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">イ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">こと・こと.なる・け</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">異常</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いじょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">异常；不寻常；非凡；罕见</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">異なる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ことなる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">不同；有区别；相异；有分歧；相差</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">異議</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いぎ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">异议；反对意见；抗议</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">献</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>奉献；进献；（酒等的）杯；（计数）杯</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ケン・コン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">たてまつ.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">貢献</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こうけん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">贡献；效力；进贡；纳贡</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">献立</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こんだて</span><span class=\"k-wz\">菜单；菜谱；节目单；日程；安排</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">文献</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぶんけん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">文献；文献资料；参考文献</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">厳</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>严厉；严肃；严格；严峻；森严</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ゲン・ゴン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">おごそ.か・きび.しい・いか.めしい・いつくし</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w