ng=\"ja\">ルイ・ライ・スイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">とりで</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">邦</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>祖国；国家；日本</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ホウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">くに</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">連邦</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">れんぽう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">联邦；邦联；联合体</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">素</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>基本；本质；素（未经加工）；裸露</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ソ・ス</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">もと</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">素</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">もと</span><span class=\"k-wz\">起源；源头；开端；基础；基底；根基；根本；原因；起因；（原）材料；原料；配料；底料（如蛋糕用）；高汤；己方；自己一边；本金；本钱；成本价；（植物的）根；（树的）主干；（笔、筷子等的）握持部分；柄部；和歌的前三句；（植物或树木的计数单位）株；棵；（鹰猎中鹰的计数单位）只</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">酸素</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さんそ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">氧；氧气</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">要素</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ようそ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">成分；因素；要素；项目；元素；成员</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">遣</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>派遣；赠送；使用；做（动作）；给予</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</spa